# SITL ONLY (watcher bench 2c, docs/handovers/2026-10-11_watcher_sitl_bench.md). Loaded after copter.parm and
# gazebo-iris.parm by realflight/sitl_bench/bench.py, in its OWN SITL working directory. Never used by a thesis flight.
# EKF3 flies as rung 1 would: no GPS, a downward optical-flow sensor for horizontal velocity, a downward rangefinder
# for height, compass yaw (amendments A4/A5 below: the thesis camera-flow and Gazebo-LiDAR paths).
AHRS_EKF_TYPE 3
EK2_ENABLE 0
EK3_ENABLE 1
GPS1_TYPE 0
SIM_GPS1_ENABLE 0
EK3_SRC1_POSXY 0
EK3_SRC1_VELXY 5
EK3_SRC1_POSZ 2
EK3_SRC1_VELZ 0
EK3_SRC1_YAW 1
EK3_FLOW_USE 1
# Amendment A5 (smoke run 5): SITL's own flow sensor (FLOW_TYPE 10) drifted ~0.25 m/s in the hover (3 m in 12 s): with
# the JSON/Gazebo model SITL's height above ground is offset (see A4), and SIM_FLOW scales by it. REPLACED by the
# thesis's verified camera-flow path (downward camera -> flow_tracker -> flow_bridge -> OPTICAL_FLOW; flow_ekf.parm,
# FLOW_TYPE 5, loaded before this file) over the textured mat of iris_textured (20 x 20 m, no walls; box +-3 m).
SIM_FLOW_ENABLE 0
FLOW_POS_Z 0.25
FS_EKF_ACTION 1
FS_THR_ENABLE 3
LOG_DISARMED 1
LOG_REPLAY 1
# links: SERIAL1 = the watcher (through the relay), SERIAL2 = the bench operator, SERIAL3 = the B6b observer watcher
SERIAL1_PROTOCOL 2
SERIAL2_PROTOCOL 2
SERIAL3_PROTOCOL 2
# mode switch (channel 5): <=1230 GUIDED, 1231-1360 ALT_HOLD, 1361-1490 STABILIZE, 1491-1620 GUIDED (SITL's 1500
# default), 1621-1749 ALT_HOLD, >=1750 LAND
FLTMODE_CH 5
FLTMODE1 4
FLTMODE2 2
FLTMODE3 0
FLTMODE4 4
FLTMODE5 2
FLTMODE6 9
# Amendment A2/A4 (2026-10-11, smoke runs 2-4): the SITL analog rangefinder (gazebo-iris.parm, SIM_SONAR) read 0.0 m
# on the ground and up to ~1.3 m, then ~1.4 m short of the truth, so EKF3 had no pre-arm relative position ("Need
# Position Estimate") and later a wrong height (take-off to 3.7 m true). REPLACED by the thesis stack's own verified
# rangefinder: the Gazebo gpu_lidar via lidar_bridge.py (MAVLink DISTANCE_SENSOR), with lidar_rangefinder.parm loaded
# before this file (RNGFND1_TYPE 10, MIN 0.05: it reads 0.075 m at rest, as a real downward rangefinder would).
# Amendment A3 (smoke run 4): at the default 2.5 m/s climb the take-off overshot to 3.0 m true height (EKF3's
# rangefinder height lags in the fast climb) and breached the box top. Climb at 0.5 m/s. Precision landing (from
# gazebo-iris.parm, no IR-LOCK here) is switched off: it only adds "PrecLand: Failsafe Measures" messages.
WPNAV_SPEED_UP 50
PILOT_SPEED_UP 50
PLND_ENABLED 0
